{
  "info": {
    "name": "API Careexpand",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas de la API de pacientes y citas.\n\nCOMO USARLA\n1. Arranca la API: docker compose up -d && npm run dev\n2. Ejecuta 'Auth > Login'. Su script guarda el token automaticamente.\n3. El resto de peticiones ya lo usan: no hay que copiar nada.\n\nEl token caduca a la hora: si empiezan a salir 401, repite el Login.\n\nLa peticion 'Pacientes > Eliminar' borra el paciente 1, asi que la segunda\nvez devolvera 404. Es lo esperado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "La API responde",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Ruta publica. Solo confirma que el servidor esta vivo."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo3@careexpand.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo1234\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo Tres\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "201 con id, email y name. Sin password_hash: eso lo garantiza UserView.\n409 si el email ya existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@careexpand.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el JWT y lo guarda en la variable {{token}}.\nTarda ~90 ms por bcrypt; el resto van a 1-9 ms."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Guarda el token en una variable de la coleccion",
                  "// para que el resto de peticiones lo usen solas.",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", body.token);",
                  "  console.log(\"Token guardado\");",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.warn(\"La respuesta no traia token\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con credenciales incorrectas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@careexpand.com\",\n  \"password\": \"incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "401 'Malas credenciales'. El mismo mensaje que si el email no existe,\npara impedir la enumeracion de usuarios."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 401\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
